WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.038 --> 00:00:14.429
Cora swam into her den.

2
00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:22.470
She yawned and stretched her arms.

3
00:00:22.471 --> 00:00:27.284
"What a busy day," she thought.

4
00:00:27.285 --> 00:00:31.207
"I'm going to take a long nap."

5
00:00:31.208 --> 00:00:35.437
Cora lay down and closed her eyes.

6
00:00:35.438 --> 00:00:39.644
Then she heard a soft sobbing sound.

7
00:00:39.645 --> 00:00:42.500
Someone was in her den!

8
00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:47.730
Cora sat up. "Who's there?"

9
00:00:47.731 --> 00:00:52.237
"It's just me," a small voice said.

10
00:00:52.238 --> 00:00:55.366
Cora looked around her den.

11
00:00:55.367 --> 00:00:59.962
But she didn't see anyone.

12
00:00:59.963 --> 00:01:09.253
"Who's me?" Cora asked.

13
00:01:09.254 --> 00:01:14.887
A butterfly fish appeared.

14
00:01:14.888 --> 00:01:19.691
"I'm Darla," the butterfly fish said.

15
00:01:19.692 --> 00:01:23.769
She wiped her eyes. "I'm sorry.

16
00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:30.149
I shouldn't be here—I'll leave right now."

17
00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:35.415
"Wait!" Cora said. "You look upset.

18
00:01:35.416 --> 00:01:39.892
Are you okay?"

19
00:01:39.893 --> 00:01:46.814
"No." Darla shook her head. "I'm lost.

20
00:01:46.815 --> 00:01:51.012
I can't find my family."

21
00:01:51.013 --> 00:01:54.727
"That's terrible," Cora said.

22
00:01:54.728 --> 00:01:57.379
"You must be scared."

23
00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:59.225
Darla nodded.

24
00:01:59.226 --> 00:02:04.568
"Do you know someone called Cora?"

25
00:02:04.569 --> 00:02:10.643
"I do." Cora smiled. "Why?"

26
00:02:10.644 --> 00:02:15.325
"Everyone told me to find her," Darla said.

27
00:02:15.326 --> 00:02:19.213
"They said she's really good at helping."

28
00:02:19.214 --> 00:02:23.407
"I'm Cora," Cora said.

29
00:02:23.408 --> 00:02:27.282
"And I am good at helping.

30
00:02:27.283 --> 00:02:30.589
Come with me, Darla.

31
00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:36.914
We're going to visit my special compass!"

